untrusted comment: minisign public key — PLACEHOLDER
REPLACE_THIS_WITH_OUTPUT_OF: minisign -G -s ntask.key -p ntask.pub -W
Then copy the literal content of ntask.pub into tauri.conf.json plugins.updater.pubkey.
NEVER reference it as a $ENV_VAR — Tauri 2 does not resolve env vars in that field.
See PROC-3 in E-desktop-tauri.md for keypair generation instructions.
